  "spec": ["REH 4.10", "REH 4.2", "REH 3"],
  "description": "REH 4.10: in states 6 / 8 a building is auto-budgeted, before it is graded (so on last cycle's served population), when its service's global flag (slots 52-55) or its own property 0x6C05FC4D (slot 57) is set: (a, b) := (0, 0), GetOccupantFundingPercentages, then EstimateIdealFunding and SetOccupantFundingPercentages(a', b). School 1 (capacity 1000, effective capacity 1000, served 500 last cycle, staff department funding 0.8, vehicle 0.75): no flag -> no step; its own flag -> staff 500 / 1000 = 0.5 and the vehicle's 0.75 written back; served 0xFFFFFFFF (not graded) -> EstimateIdealFunding fails, no step; the global flag alone with last cycle's served 1500 -> the max funding 0x3F999999. Each grading leaves served = 500 (the tract's 500 residents). Hospital 2 has no vehicle item, so SetOccupantFundingPercentages stops after the staff percentage.",
  "steps": [
